{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeUmXjaENdoY64kG8Bj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bottom of the page has more text, with \"מק\"ם\" and \"BANK-15\". That's not for me. I got what I came for, so I'm stopping here.\n\nBasically: if my money just sits in the current account, it shrinks. The page's example is 10,000 ₪, which after 10 years is worth only 8,203 ₪ in today's money, so \"1,797 ₪ פחות\" (less). In a \"קרן כספית\" (some fund the page compares it to) it would have been 2,576 ₪ better. I have 30,000, so I guess it's about three times that, but I never saw my own number on the screen, so I'm fairly sure, not certain. What decided it was \"בעו\"ש שווים 8,203 ₪ בכסף של היום\" (in the current account it's worth 8,203 ₪ in today's money).\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Where I looked, in order:**\n  - The heading \"חשבון עובר ושב\" (current account). It was what I was looking for, so I stayed.\n  - The first text block. I skimmed it; \"15,000.00 ₪\" caught my eye.\n  - The heading \"למה משתמשים בזה\" (why people use this). I scrolled past.\n  - The calculator \"כמה עולה להשאיר כסף בעו\"ש?\" (how much does it cost to leave money in the current account?). This was the part I actually wanted. It showed 8,203 and 1,797 less.\n  - A field with 10,000 and a \"כמה שנים\" (how many years) slider. I'd put in 30,000, but what I see is still the 10,000 example.\n  - The chart: a yellow line \"בקרן כספית\" goes up, the \"בעו\"ש\" (current account) line goes down, and between them \"המחיר של להשאיר 2,576 ₪\" (the price of leaving it).\n  - A second calculator with a big 62,681 ₪, next to \"ההפקדות שלכם 70,000 ₪\" (your deposits). That's with 500 a month and 0% interest.\n  - The \"שווה לדעת\" (worth knowing) section: \"4 מתוך 8 הבנקים\" (4 of the 8 banks) pay interest, only up to 10,000 ₪. I stopped after that.\n- **Didn't read:** the small grey text about 2% and 3.25%, the \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית\" fold (some banks do pay interest), \"הצגה כטבלה\" (show as table), and everything below \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\" (who offers it and who supervises).\n- **Words I didn't get:** \"קרן כספית\", \"מק\"ם\", \"BANK-35\", \"BANK-15\", \"מסלול העמלות\" (fee plan).\n- **What bothered me:**\n  - Three different shekel numbers for what feels like the same question: 1,797 less, 2,576 \"price\", and then 62,681 against 70,000.\n  - I couldn't see the result for my own 30,000.\n  - The second calculator says \"בכסף של היום\" (in today's money) with 500 ₪ a month, so it doesn't match the first one. I got a bit lost there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4047,"cache_read_input_tokens":11865,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4047},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fc1759e-8942-456a-bc83-63247a633572","uuid":"de1fd39d-610d-4dce-8b1e-16ca2bf55c7e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:07:42.551Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeUmJ5ug3q5RZUEv8dL"}
